01:32:02,620 --> 01:32:05,900
It's the idea what probability theory can't capture radical

319
01:32:05,900 --> 01:32:08,420
uncertainty or the unknown unknowns

320
01:32:08,900 --> 01:32:09,820
or something like that.

321
01:32:09,820 --> 01:32:13,220
Right. Now, my view is you can always think

