01:32:31,980 --> 01:32:33,120
Right. And once you know that,

331
01:32:33,160 --> 01:32:34,600
then you really know the important thing.

332
01:32:34,600 --> 01:32:37,240
And the other stuff, to me, is just a bunch of details.

333
01:32:37,240 --> 01:32:40,660
Like, who cares why your business is going to fail as long

334
01:32:40,660 --> 01:32:42,400
as you know that nine out of ten will?

335
01:32:43,380 --> 01:32:45,120
Right. You know, you have knowledge

336
01:32:45,120 --> 01:32:46,500
about the fact that it's important.

337
01:32:46,500 --> 01:32:48,520
And the other thing, the exact details of what it is.

338
01:32:49,080 --> 01:32:49,260
All right.

339
01:32:49,260 --> 01:32:51,300
Maybe if you knew what it was, you could prevent it.

340
01:32:51,300 --> 01:32:54,100
But, of course, part of the reason why people don't prevent

341
01:32:54,100 --> 01:32:55,620
it is because it's so complicated.

342
01:32:55,680 --> 01:32:58,300
But it doesn't seem like that's such a big deal to me.

343
01:32:59,500 --> 01:32:59,760
All right.

344
01:33:00,000 --> 01:33:01,780
So questions about search theory?

345
01:33:01,780 --> 01:33:03,040
All right.

346
01:33:03,100 --> 01:33:05,400
So can change your life if you want to make it change your life?

347
01:33:05,600 --> 01:33:06,540
All right.

348
01:33:06,540 --> 01:33:10,620
Yes. So when we do, when we actually do behavioral economics,

