01:33:10,620 --> 01:33:15,620
I think actually one result that I am very convinced of now is

350
01:33:15,620 --> 01:33:18,540
that in the modern world, people really just don't try enough.

351
01:33:19,160 --> 01:33:20,800
And they just don't throw the dice in life

352
01:33:20,800 --> 01:33:22,360
in nearly enough times.

353
01:33:23,000 --> 01:33:25,420
So if the worst that's going to happen is you'll be rejected

354
01:33:25,420 --> 01:33:29,700
or humiliated, in the modern world, there are so many millions

355
01:33:29,700 --> 01:33:31,540
of possibilities, and the word

356
01:33:31,540 --> 01:33:33,700
of mouth does not get around very easily.

357
01:33:33,700 --> 01:33:36,480
So why not just go and throw a whole lot

