01:57:29,000 --> 01:57:29,880
Who knows?

409
01:57:29,880 --> 01:57:31,440
60% chance I like them.

410
01:57:31,440 --> 01:57:33,200
40% chance I don't.

411
01:57:33,200 --> 01:57:34,520
What should I do?

412
01:57:34,520 --> 01:57:35,360
Right?

413
01:57:35,360 --> 01:57:38,440
And the answer is you just want to maximize.6

414
01:57:38,440 --> 01:57:40,200
times the one utility function,

415
01:57:40,200 --> 01:57:42,280
plus.4 times the other utility function,

416
01:57:42,280 --> 01:57:44,040
and that's the optimal thing to do.

417
01:57:46,480 --> 01:57:47,360
All right.

418
01:57:47,360 --> 01:57:49,680
Now, when would this not be optimal,

419
01:57:49,680 --> 01:57:50,960
