01:81:41,400 --> 01:81:43,060
Right? Now, again, there's always the fear

39
01:81:43,060 --> 01:81:43,840
that this could lead

40
01:81:43,840 --> 01:81:47,080
to the employer deliberately making up accusations.

41
01:81:47,560 --> 01:81:49,000
But again, there's a simple answer.

42
01:81:49,420 --> 01:81:51,960
If you're worried about that, don't sign.

43
01:81:53,080 --> 01:81:54,660
Right? And this, of course, gives an incentive

44
01:81:54,660 --> 01:81:57,920
to moderate the contractual punishment down to the level

45
01:81:57,920 --> 01:81:58,980
people feel comfortable with.

46
01:81:59,400 --> 01:82:01,800
But still, that's probably a very large amount.

47
01:82:02,900 --> 01:82:04,680
Right? And enough to go and solve a lot

48
01:82:04,680 --> 01:82:06,020
of these moral hazard problems that we see.

49
01:82:07,000 --> 01:82:11,400
So, I mean, right now, if, say, you sign a life insurance

50
01:82:11,400 --> 01:82:12,840
contract that says that you don't,

